  "development_notes": [
    "Source record block-0917/record-00028 is the real original block scene. The new course approaches the stairs straight, angles at the ramp lip and maintains pressure against the same wall in both directions. Stock input recentres between eight trajectories; no test writes actor poses.",
    "Before corrections, the source fixture reproduced a clear capsule with target_footprint_support_missing. Measured obstacle-normal tread sampling fixes angle-dependent toe placement. Actual walls above legal riser height constrain original input, with at most four redirects and no reverse motion.",
    "Original tread faces can end 0.025 m inside their enclosing walls. A missing outer floor sample requires a real nearby vertical wall and a real floor inside it. Full capsule dimensions/margins, native contact, centre/other footprint, floor span and genuine drop tests remain enforced.",
